' ===========================================================================
' Built-in `term::` package source.
'
' Declares the `LineStyle` enum (the box-drawing weight `term::drawHLine` /
' `term::drawVLine` / `term::drawBox` stamp) and the `FillStyle` enum (the block/
' shade `term::fillRect` stamps). The drawing callables are lowered directly in
' native codegen (console + app backends) — this source only provides the enum
' types so `LineStyle.Light` … and `FillStyle.Filled` … resolve. The term records
' `TermColor` / `TermSize` remain native builtin types (declared in `term.rs`).
'
' Each `LineStyle` variant maps to a horizontal glyph (drawHLine) and a vertical
' glyph (drawVLine); the discriminants are the 0-based positions used by native
' codegen to select the glyph: `Light = 0`, `Heavy = 1`, `LightDash = 2`,
' `HeavyDash = 3`, `LightDot = 4`, `HeavyDot = 5`, `Double = 6`. `FillStyle`
' discriminants likewise: `Filled = 0`, `Light = 1`, `Medium = 2`, `Dark = 3`,
' `Checker = 4`, `CheckerAlt = 5`.
' ===========================================================================

DOC
  ENUM LineStyle
  DESC Selects the box-drawing weight `term::drawHLine` and `term::drawVLine`
  DESC stamp into the surface. Each variant has a horizontal form (used by
  DESC drawHLine) and a vertical form (used by drawVLine).
  PROP Light Thin single line (─ │).
  PROP Heavy Thick single line (━ ┃).
  PROP LightDash Thin triple-dash line (┄ ┆).
  PROP HeavyDash Thick triple-dash line (┅ ┇).
  PROP LightDot Thin quadruple-dot line (┈ ┊).
  PROP HeavyDot Thick quadruple-dot line (┉ ┋).
  PROP Double Double line (═ ║).
END DOC
EXPORT ENUM LineStyle
  Light           ' ─ │
  Heavy           ' ━ ┃
  LightDash       ' ┄ ┆
  HeavyDash       ' ┅ ┇
  LightDot        ' ┈ ┊
  HeavyDot        ' ┉ ┋
  Double          ' ═ ║
END ENUM

DOC
  ENUM FillStyle
  DESC Selects the block or shade glyph `term::fillRect` stamps into every cell
  DESC of a rectangular region.
  PROP Filled Solid full block (█).
  PROP Light Light shade (░).
  PROP Medium Medium shade (▒).
  PROP Dark Dark shade (▓).
  PROP Checker Upper-left + lower-right quadrants (▚).
  PROP CheckerAlt Upper-right + lower-left quadrants (▞).
END DOC
EXPORT ENUM FillStyle
  Filled          ' █
  Light           ' ░
  Medium          ' ▒
  Dark            ' ▓
  Checker         ' ▚
  CheckerAlt      ' ▞
END ENUM
